WEBVTT

00:00:04.435 --> 00:00:07.115
I've never seen anything like you today.
You were on a roll.

00:00:07.195 --> 00:00:10.035
Another day like this
and that scare record's in the bag.

00:00:10.155 --> 00:00:11.595
That's right, baby.

00:00:16.115 --> 00:00:19.515
As if dinner wasn't enough,
I'm taking her to a monster truck rally.

00:00:19.595 --> 00:00:21.115
-Nice.
-What's on your agenda?

00:00:21.195 --> 00:00:23.515
-Work out some more.
-Again?

00:00:23.795 --> 00:00:25.595
There's more to life than scaring.

00:00:25.595 --> 00:00:26.955
(SNIFFING)

00:00:26.995 --> 00:00:32.195
-Can I borrow your odorant?
-I got smelly garbage or old dumpster.

00:00:32.595 --> 00:00:35.195
You got low tide?
How about wet dog?

00:00:35.275 --> 00:00:36.835
Yep. Stink it up.

00:00:38.475 --> 00:00:39.915
(GROWLING)

00:00:39.955 --> 00:00:42.635
I am so romantic sometimes
I think I should marry myself.

00:00:42.715 --> 00:00:45.755
-Give me a break.
-What a night of romance ahead of me.

00:00:45.795 --> 00:00:49.155
Tonight is about me and Celia.

00:00:49.595 --> 00:00:52.315
The love boat is about to set sail.

00:00:52.355 --> 00:00:53.515
(IMITATING SHIP HORN)

00:00:53.595 --> 00:00:57.515
I gotta tell you, that face of hers,
it just makes my heart go... Yikes!

00:00:57.635 --> 00:01:01.875
Hello, Wazowski.
Fun-filled evening planned for tonight?

00:01:01.955 --> 00:01:03.195
Well, as a matter of fact...

00:01:03.275 --> 00:01:06.675
I'm sure you filed
your paperwork correctly,

00:01:06.995 --> 00:01:08.355
for once.

00:01:09.515 --> 00:01:13.155
Your stunned silence
is very reassuring.

00:01:13.355 --> 00:01:15.155
My scare reports.
I left them on my desk.

00:01:15.755 --> 00:01:19.115
If I'm not at the restaurant in five
minutes they'll give our table away.

00:01:19.195 --> 00:01:20.795
-Schmoopsie-pooh.
-Googly bear.

00:01:20.835 --> 00:01:23.715
-Want to get going?
-Do I ever. It's just...

00:01:23.795 --> 00:01:25.115
-What?
-It...

00:01:25.195 --> 00:01:26.675
-A small...
-I don't understand.

00:01:27.115 --> 00:01:29.675
I forgot about some paperwork
I was supposed to file.

00:01:29.915 --> 00:01:31.675
Mike was reminding me.

00:01:31.715 --> 00:01:33.635
-Thanks, buddy.
-I was?

00:01:33.995 --> 00:01:35.235
I mean, I was. Yeah.

00:01:35.315 --> 00:01:37.435
-OK. Let's go.
-We're going.

00:01:38.515 --> 00:01:39.515
The pink copies to accounting.

00:01:39.555 --> 00:01:43.315
The fuchsia ones go to purchasing
and the goldenrod ones go to Roz.

00:01:43.355 --> 00:01:45.435
Leave the puce.

00:01:47.715 --> 00:01:50.355
Pink copies to accounting,
fuchsia ones to Roz.

00:01:50.435 --> 00:01:52.475
The fuchsia ones go to purchasing.

00:01:52.635 --> 00:01:54.275
The goldenrod ones go to Roz.

00:01:54.795 --> 00:01:57.275
Man, I have no idea what puce is.

00:02:00.595 --> 00:02:01.875
Oh, that's puce.

00:02:04.235 --> 00:02:05.195
Hmm?

00:02:07.395 --> 00:02:08.835
Hello?

00:02:09.035 --> 00:02:12.475
Anyone? There's a door here.

00:02:28.955 --> 00:02:30.915
(CREAKING)

00:02:33.275 --> 00:02:35.075
(WHISPERING) Hello? Hey.

00:02:36.275 --> 00:02:37.915
Anybody scaring in here?

00:02:38.595 --> 00:02:40.955
Hello. Yo.

00:02:49.675 --> 00:02:51.035
(THUMP)

00:02:57.995 --> 00:02:58.995
(SPEAKING BABY TALK)

00:02:59.075 --> 00:03:01.755
(SCREAMING)

00:03:03.995 --> 00:03:05.955
(GIRL GIGGLING)

00:03:11.475 --> 00:03:13.435
(SQUEALS IN DELIGHT)

00:03:17.195 --> 00:03:18.195
(GASPS)

00:03:24.315 --> 00:03:25.475
(GIGGLING)

00:03:26.035 --> 00:03:27.795
(TOY DUCKS QUACKING)

00:03:29.555 --> 00:03:30.875
(YELLING)

00:03:35.435 --> 00:03:36.795
(QUACKING)

00:04:02.315 --> 00:04:03.595
(SIGHS)

00:04:05.635 --> 00:04:06.635
(YELLS)

00:04:06.675 --> 00:04:09.075
(PANTING)

00:04:20.035 --> 00:04:21.155
Whew.

00:04:28.515 --> 00:04:30.995
(SULLEY SCREAMING)

00:04:31.035 --> 00:04:32.515
(LITTLE GIRL SPEAKING BABY TALK)

00:04:32.555 --> 00:04:33.795
Kitty.

00:04:34.795 --> 00:04:36.555
No, no, stay back.

00:04:36.635 --> 00:04:37.675
(SPEAKING BABY TALK)

00:04:39.355 --> 00:04:40.395
(STUTTERS IN FEAR)

00:04:40.475 --> 00:04:41.515
(GIGGLING)

00:04:47.035 --> 00:04:48.795
(WHINE OF DISGUST)

00:04:59.555 --> 00:05:00.755
Hmm.

00:05:11.075 --> 00:05:13.155
(SPEAKING BABY TALK)

00:05:16.635 --> 00:05:17.915
(SNEEZES)

